\f0\fs24 \cf0 User Stories\
\
As a shopper I want to see a list of products and filter the products so I can find specific items I am looking for.\
Given the app is on Products, when products are loaded, a list of available products is displayed on screen.\
Given the search bar is tapped, when the query is typed, the product list updates to match.\
Given the user taps Saved or History, the associated products are displayed.\
\
As I shopper I want to see information about a product so I can be informed before making a purchase decision.\
As a customer I want to see my order history so I can see my purchases. \
Given the user taps the Orders button, when the page loads, the orders are displayed.\
Given the user taps an order, the order loads, then items and info about the order are displayed.\
\
As a user with poor internet connection, when my internet fails, I don\'92t want the app to crash on me.\
Given there is a network error, when the page fails to load, then a retry message appears.}